OL,3,GNEWSAYoga and origami: Inside Russell
OL,4,ABrand's new prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA roster including weekly yoga classes,
OL,7,Fa football league, and origami lessons
OL,8,Fmight sound like the schedule at your
OL,9,Flocal village hall.
OL,11,FBut it is also what is on offer at the
OL,12,Fprison where the disgraced comedian
OL,13,FRussell Brand has been moved to.
OL,15,FThe 51-year-old from Grays in Essex was
OL,16,Fmoved to HMP Littlehey, in rural
OL,17,FCambridgeshire, over the weekend.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
